        "heading": "Ladies Who Launch: Season 4",
        "logo_image": "shopify://shop_images/lwllogo3.png",
        "subheading": "Where ambitious women connect, collaborate, and thrive.",
        "copy": "<p>For four years, Leading Ladies has been successfully bridging like-minded women through meaningful conversations, authentic relationships, and transformative experiences.</p><p>From entrepreneurs and founders to executives, professionals, and creators, our community continues to grow because we believe success is even more powerful when shared.</p><p>Join us for Ladies Who Launch Season 4 and become part of a movement that empowers women to lead boldly, grow confidently, and support one another every step of the way.</p>",
        "event_datetime": "2026-11-14T10:00:00+08:00",
        "primary_label": "Reserve Your Spot",
        "primary_link": "/collections/ladies-who-launch-season-4",
        "secondary_label": "Learn More",
        "secondary_link": "/pages/about-1"
