      },
      "block_order": ["photo_1", "photo_2", "photo_3", "photo_4", "photo_5", "photo_6"],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Four Years of Meaningful Connections",
        "copy": "<p>For four years, Leading Ladies has brought together a growing community of women leaders, entrepreneurs, creators, and professionals who believe in the power of collaboration and shared success.</p><p>Every event has sparked conversations, partnerships, friendships, mentorships, and opportunities that continue long after the event ends.</p><p>Through Ladies Who Launch, we've successfully bridged like-minded women from different industries, backgrounds, and stages of business, creating a thriving ecosystem of support and growth.</p>"
      }
    },
    "lwl_about": {
      "type": "lwl-about",
      "settings": {
        "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/eventpics-5.jpg",
        "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/eventpics-7.jpg",
        "heading": "A Community Built By Women, For Women",
        "copy": "<p>Leading Ladies was founded with a simple but powerful vision: to create a space where women leaders, entrepreneurs, and creators can connect, learn, and grow together.</p><p>Over the last four years, we have successfully bridged like-minded women across industries, backgrounds, and stages of business.</p><p>What started as intimate gatherings has evolved into a thriving community built on authentic relationships, collaboration, growth, and support. We believe that when women lift one another up, remarkable things happen.</p><p>Today, Leading Ladies continues to create opportunities for women to share knowledge, build confidence, expand networks, and unlock new possibilities.</p>"
      }
    },
