      "block_order": ["step_1", "step_2", "step_3", "step_4", "step_5"],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Four Years of Connecting Women Who Lead",
        "copy": "<p>For four years, Leading Ladies has remained committed to creating spaces where women can build meaningful relationships, exchange ideas, and support each other's growth.</p><p>Through numerous events, workshops, and gatherings, we have successfully connected like-minded women who continue to collaborate, mentor, inspire, and create impact together.</p><p>Season 4 celebrates that journey and welcomes a new generation of women who are ready to launch their next chapter.</p>"
      }
